      "value": "Related.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/vrc-animator-tracking-control-is-failing-to-recognize-the-control-state-of-the-e\n\nI also encountered the same bug recently. This issue is liable to surface in 11-point FBT setups—specifically, environments that track the elbows. (You shouldn't assume that no one would ever switch to animation mode while using 11-point FBT.)",
